==Latin==

===Etymology===
From {{der|la|ine-pro|*atro-ek}}, from {{m|ine-pro||*h₂eh₁tro-h₃kʷs|having the appearance of fire}}, from {{m|ine-pro||*h₂eh₁tro-}} (suffixed, metathesized form of {{m|ine-pro|*h₂eh₁ter-||fire}}) + {{m|ine-pro|*h₃ekʷ-||eye; to see}}. The first root also gives the cognates of {{cog|ae|𐬁𐬙𐬀𐬭𐬱||fire}}, {{cog|xum|𐌀𐌈𐌓𐌖}}, {{cog|osc|𐌀𐌀𐌃𐌝𐌓𐌉𐌉𐌔}}, {{cog|ga|áith||kiln}}.

